WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.634 --> 00:00:02.968
-Finally, guys, it is Monday,
a start of a brand new week

00:00:02.968 --> 00:00:04.601
and I think we all could use a
little encouragement

00:00:04.601 --> 00:00:06.367
to get things going
on the right foot.

00:00:06.367 --> 00:00:08.801
With that in mind, it's time for
some "Monday Motivations"

00:00:08.801 --> 00:00:09.934
Here we go.

00:00:09.934 --> 00:00:11.167
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:11.167 --> 00:00:13.267
-Monday Motivations.

00:00:13.267 --> 00:00:15.267
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:17.033 --> 00:00:20.767
-Hey, your hair looks
great today.

00:00:20.767 --> 00:00:22.767
[ Applause ]

00:00:24.033 --> 00:00:26.667
You're gonna have
an amazing week.

00:00:26.667 --> 00:00:28.667
[ Applause ]

00:00:29.734 --> 00:00:31.534
When you're fishing
and you throw one back,

00:00:31.534 --> 00:00:33.634
it swims over to it's friends
like, "Guys, it happened.

00:00:33.634 --> 00:00:35.367
I finally met Andrew.

00:00:35.367 --> 00:00:38.267
[ Applause ]

00:00:38.267 --> 00:00:40.267
When you zone out waiting for
your pizza rolls,

00:00:40.267 --> 00:00:43.567
your microwave is like
"OMG, is he looking at me?"

00:00:43.567 --> 00:00:45.567
[ Laughter ]

00:00:47.033 --> 00:00:50.367
Your JV soccer coach still talks
about that gaol you made.

00:00:50.367 --> 00:00:51.868
Well, almost made.

00:00:51.868 --> 00:00:53.868
[ Applause ]

00:00:54.901 --> 00:00:56.667
When you sit down next to
someone on an airplane,

00:00:56.667 --> 00:01:00.100
they're, like, "Jackpot.
Hello future husband."

00:01:00.100 --> 00:01:02.100
[ Applause ]

00:01:03.133 --> 00:01:05.667
You didn't hear it, but one time
your favorite teacher

00:01:05.667 --> 00:01:07.834
accidentally called you "Son."

00:01:07.834 --> 00:01:09.834
[ Laughter ]

00:01:11.400 --> 00:01:14.234
And finally, they gym
turned you away on January 1st

00:01:14.234 --> 00:01:17.968
because they didn't want to give
people unrealistic expectations.

